    "比如两班倒今天是第二个夜班，就选对应的那一天。选好后整个日历会自动排好。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比如两班倒今天是第二个夜班，就选对应的那一天。选好后整个日历会自动排好。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose the day that matches your current shift in the cycle. The calendar will fill in automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇循環中與今天班次相符的那一天，行事曆就會自動排好。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いまの周期で今日にあたる日を選ぶと、カレンダーが自動で埋まります。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle den Tag, der zu deiner aktuellen Schicht im Zyklus passt. Der Kalender füllt sich automatisch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "比如：白班、A班、大夜": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比如：白班、A班、大夜"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example Day, Team A, or Night"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如日班、A班、大夜"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例：日勤、A班、夜勤"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zum Beispiel Tag, Team A oder Nacht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没认出排班口令。请让同事在「班历 > 设置 > 把排班发给同事」里发给你，复制整段话再点粘贴。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没认出排班口令。请让同事在「班历 > 设置 > 把排班发给同事」里发给你，复制整段话再点粘贴。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Code not recognized. Ask your coworker to share it from ShiftCal > Settings > Share rotation with team. Copy the full message and tap Paste."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法辨識排班口令。請同事從「班曆 > 設定 > 將班表傳給同事」傳送，複製整段訊息後再點「貼上」。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コードを認識できませんでした。同僚に「ShiftCal」>「設定」>「ローテーションをチームと共有」から送ってもらい、メッセージ全体をコピーして「貼り付け」をタップしてください。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Code nicht erkannt. Bitte deinen Kollegen, ihn über ShiftCal > Einstellungen > Rhythmus mit dem Team teilen zu senden. Kopiere die ganze Nachricht und tippe auf Einfügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
