    "按顺序排：上什么班、连上几天": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按顺序排：上什么班、连上几天"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In order: which shift, how many days in a row"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "依序排列：上什麼班、連上幾天"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "順番に：どの勤務を何日連続か"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Reihe nach: welche Schicht, wie viele Tage am Stück"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "比如「白班 3 天、休息 2 天」就是上三休二。左滑删除一段，点右上角「编辑」可以拖动排序。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比如「白班 3 天、休息 2 天」就是上三休二。左滑删除一段，点右上角「编辑」可以拖动排序。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For example, Day shift 3 d + Off 2 d means 3 on, 2 off. Swipe left to delete a block; tap Edit to reorder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如「日班 3 天、休息 2 天」就是上三休二。左滑可刪除一段，點右上角「編輯」可拖曳排序。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例：日勤3日＋休み2日で3勤2休。左にスワイプでブロック削除、「編集」で並べ替え。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zum Beispiel Tagschicht 3 T + Frei 2 T heißt 3 Dienst, 2 frei. Wische nach links zum Löschen eines Blocks; tippe auf Bearbeiten zum Umsortieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点班次可以改名称、上下班时间和颜色，比如加一个「大夜」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点班次可以改名称、上下班时间和颜色，比如加一个「大夜」。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a shift to change its name, hours and color, or add a new one like Graveyard."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點班次可修改名稱、上下班時間和顏色，例如新增一個「大夜」。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "勤務をタップすると名前・時間・色を変更できます。「深夜勤」のように新しく追加することもできます。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tippe auf eine Schicht, um Name, Zeiten und Farbe zu ändern, oder füge eine neue hinzu, z. B. Nachtwache."
          }
        }
      }
    },
