    "删除「%@」？删除后不能恢复；如果正在用它，日历照旧不变。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除「%@」？删除后不能恢复；如果正在用它，日历照旧不变。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete “%@”? This can't be undone. If it's in use, your calendar stays as it is."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除「%@」？刪除後無法復原；如果正在使用，行事曆維持不變。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」を削除しますか？元に戻せません。使用中の場合、カレンダーはそのまま残ります。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„%@“ löschen? Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden. Ist er in Benutzung, bleibt dein Kalender unverändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "循环：上什么班、连上几天": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "循环：上什么班、连上几天"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rotation: which shift, how many days in a row"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "循環：上什麼班、連上幾天"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ローテーション：どの勤務を何日連続か"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rhythmus: welche Schicht, wie viele Tage am Stück"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点名字直接改，点色块换颜色。新增的班次加到上面的循环里才会排进日历。左滑删除班次。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点名字直接改，点色块换颜色。新增的班次加到上面的循环里才会排进日历。左滑删除班次。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a name to rename it, tap the color block to change color. New shifts appear on the calendar once you add them to the rotation above. Swipe left to delete."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點名稱直接修改，點色塊換顏色。新增的班次加進上面的循環才會排入行事曆。左滑刪除班次。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名前をタップで変更、色のブロックをタップで色を変更。新しい勤務は上のローテーションに追加するとカレンダーに表示されます。左にスワイプで削除。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tippe auf einen Namen zum Umbenennen, auf den Farbblock zum Ändern der Farbe. Neue Schichten erscheinen im Kalender, sobald du sie oben in den Rhythmus aufnimmst. Nach links wischen zum Löschen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
